                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A former state, landlocked in south-central India, which was ruled from 1724 until 1948 by a line of nizams."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bc0f183-4ee8-4c38-946e-9d927ae70fb4",
                                                "sense_id": "0090d513-e7b8-32f0-a061-9c8a87e38e8c",
                                                "text": "At Indian partition in 1947, the nizam chose to resume Hyderabad's independent status, but India invaded the state (1948) and took control."
                                            },
